+	 * 6-bit Target_ID is split between MSCC_EXT_PAGE_CSR_CNTL_20 and
+	 * MSCC_EXT_PAGE_CSR_CNTL_19 registers.
+	 * Target_ID[5:2] maps to bits[3:0] of MSCC_EXT_PAGE_CSR_CNTL_20
